## THREAD PINNING (2026-08-27 night) — env at launch, not the initializer

First server launch ran at load 52 on 12 cores: `_worker_init` sets
OMP/OPENBLAS vars after numpy is imported in the spawned worker, too late.
scripts/launch_sweeps.sh now exports them before python starts (inherited
env is read at BLAS load). Restarted with the 14 finished parts reused.
